#. New Year's Day:
msgid "Jour de l'an"
msgstr "วันขึ้นปีใหม่"

#. Easter as public holiday in france including overseas terriotroies: https://www.service-
#. public.gouv.fr/particuliers/vosdroits/F24496 Article for Easter as public holiday:
#. https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/codes/section_lc/LEGITEXT000006072050/LEGISCTA000033008126/2026-01-01
#. Easter Monday.
msgid "Lundi de Pâques"
msgstr "วันจันทร์อีสเตอร์"

#. Pentecost Monday. Pentecost Monday as public holiday in france and its overseas territories:
#. https://www.service-public.gouv.fr/particuliers/vosdroits/F24496 Article for Pentecost monday as
#. public holiday:
#. https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/codes/section_lc/LEGITEXT000006072050/LEGISCTA000033008126/2026-01-01
msgid "Lundi de Pentecôte"
msgstr "วันจันทร์หลังวันสมโภชพระจิตเจ้า"

#. Labor Day. Labor day as public holiday in france including its oversesas territories:
#. https://www.service-public.gouv.fr/particuliers/vosdroits/F24496 Article for labor day as public
#. holiday:
#. https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/codes/section_lc/LEGITEXT000006072050/LEGISCTA000033008126/2026-01-01
msgid "Fête du Travail"
msgstr "วันแรงงาน"

#. Labor and Social Concord Day.
msgid "Fête du Travail et de la Concorde sociale"
msgstr "วันแรงงานและความสมานฉันท์ทางสังคม"

#. May Day.
msgid "1er mai"
msgstr "วันเมย์เดย์"

#. Victory Day. Victory day as public holiday in france and overseas territories:
#. https://www.service-public.gouv.fr/particuliers/vosdroits/F24496 article for victory day as
#. public holiday: https://www.defense.gouv.fr/terre/memoire/commemoration-du-8-mai-1945
msgid "Fête de la Victoire"
msgstr "วันแห่งชัยชนะ"

#. Ascension days as public holiday of france and its overseas territories: https://www.service-
#. public.gouv.fr/particuliers/vosdroits/F24496 Article of Ascension day as public holiday:
#. https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/codes/section_lc/LEGITEXT000006072050/LEGISCTA000033008126/2026-01-01
#. Ascension Day.
msgid "Ascension"
msgstr "วันสมโภชพระเยซูเจ้าเสด็จขึ้นสวรรค์"

#. National day as public holiday in france and its overseas territories: https://www.service-
#. public.gouv.fr/particuliers/vosdroits/F24496 Article for National day as public holiday:
#. https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/codes/section_lc/LEGITEXT000006072050/LEGISCTA000033008126/2026-01-01
#. National Day.
msgid "Fête nationale"
msgstr "วันชาติฝรั่งเศส"

#. Assumption Day as a public holiday in france and its overseas territories: https://www.service-
#. public.gouv.fr/particuliers/vosdroits/F24496 Article for assumption Day as public holiday:
#. https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/codes/section_lc/LEGITEXT000006072050/LEGISCTA000033008126/2026-01-01
#. Assumption Day.
msgid "Assomption"
msgstr "วันสมโภชแม่พระรับเกียรติยกขึ้นสวรรค์"

#. All Saints' Day.
msgid "Toussaint"
msgstr "วันสมโภชนักบุญทั้งหลาย"

#. Armistice Day.
msgid "Armistice"
msgstr "วันสงบศึก"

#. Christmas Day.
msgid "Noël"
msgstr "วันคริสต์มาส"

#. Good Friday.
msgid "Vendredi saint"
msgstr "วันศุกร์ประเสริฐ"

#. Saint Stephen's Day.
msgid "Saint-Étienne"
msgstr "วันสมโภชนักบุญสเตเฟน"

#. Mi-Careme.
msgid "Mi-Carême"
msgstr "วันเฉลิมฉลองกลางเทศกาลมหาพรต"

#. Abolition of Slavery.
#. Abolition of Slavery. Law of 30 June 1983:
#. https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/loda/id/JORFTEXT000000692257. Decree of 23 November 1983:
#. https://www.legifrance.gouv.fr/loda/id/JORFTEXT000000336997.
msgid "Abolition de l'esclavage"
msgstr "วันเลิกทาส"

#. Victor Schoelcher Day.
msgid "Fête de Victor Schoelcher"
msgstr "วันวิกตอร์ เชลแชร์"

#. Citizenship Day.
msgid "Fête de la Citoyenneté"
msgstr "วันแห่งความเป็นพลเมือง"

#. Annexation Day.
msgid "Fête de la prise de possession"
msgstr "วันประกาศอธิปไตยเหนือดินแดน"

#. Missionary Day.
msgid "Arrivée de l'Évangile"
msgstr "วันคริสตธรรมมาถึง"

#. Internal Autonomy Day.
msgid "Fête de l'autonomie"
msgstr "วันปกครองตนเอง"

#. Matāri'i.
msgid "Matāri'i"
msgstr "วันขึ้นปีใหม่โพลินีเซีย (มาตารีอิ)"

#. Feast of Saint Peter Chanel.
msgid "Saint Pierre Chanel"
msgstr "วันสมโภชนักบุญเปโตร ชาเนล"

#. Saints Peter and Paul Day.
msgid "Saints Pierre et Paul"
msgstr "วันสมโภชนักบุญเปโตรและเปาโล"

#. Territory Day.
msgid "Fête du Territoire"
msgstr "วันก่อตั้งดินแดน"
